--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Prior art and independent reproduction
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The memory-safety behaviour reproduced here (undersized-signature heap
out-of-bounds read in the verifier's fixed-size decode) was first reported by
TheDarkLightX in the MIT-licensed repository sqisign-verification-boundary and
is tracked as the OPEN upstream issue #23 (opened 2026-08-13), which the SQIsign
team has acknowledged and scheduled a fix for in the round-3 release. This
project independently reproduces that already-public issue and provides the fuzz
tooling requested in upstream issue #15. It is not a new discovery or a
vulnerability disclosure.
